TPipe Startup License 1.0

Available to legal entities meeting the eligibility conditions below at no charge.

================================================================================
ELIGIBILITY

You are eligible to use this license if ALL of the following are true:

  - Your organization has total annual revenue (ARR) of $1,000,000 USD or less.
    (If your project qualifies for the FOSS carve-out below, this revenue
    cap does not apply — see FOSS CARVE-OUT.)

  - Your use of TPipe is not competitive with TPipe (see Noncompete below)

  - You have not entered into a separate Commercial Agreement with
    Ten Trillion Triangles LLC for TPipe

If you do not meet these conditions, you may use TPipe under AGPL-3.0,
or contact Ten Trillion Triangles LLC to negotiate a Commercial Agreement.

